# SSOT Template Propagation

These files in unified-trading-pm are the canonical source. All repos copy them.

## SSOT Files

| File | Purpose | Propagation |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `scripts/setup.sh` | Environment bootstrap | Copied to all 60+ repos |
| `scripts/quality-gates.sh` | Lint + test pipeline | Copied to all Python repos |
| `scripts/quickmerge.sh` | Git + PR automation | Copied to all repos |
| `.github/workflows/version-bump.yml` | Semver on main merge | Copied to all repos |

## Rules

1. **Edit ONLY in this repo** — never edit a downstream copy directly
2. After changing a template, propagate with the rollout scripts:
   - `python3 scripts/rollout-setup-sh.py` (or equivalent)
   - Or manual: copy to each repo, commit with `chore: sync <template> from SSOT`
3. **Test the template in PM first** before propagating
4. Document template changes in `unified-trading-codex/06-coding-standards/`
